WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I think you are busy these days

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,720
It's time to change clothes

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,200
I'll come early to help you wash up.

4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:12,060
Silly girl

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,460
So early to do laundry

6
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:14,580
Come in, it's cold outside

7
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:15,940
I also brought you breakfast

8
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:22,110
Xiao Xi, thank you for eating first.

9
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,790
Look, your hands are all red from the cold

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,520
This is the medicine for heartbeat

11
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,520
Don't let the rope break

12
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:30,920
Wait for the weather to warm up

13
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,440
I'll find some more medicinal materials to supplement her.

14
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,040
Brother Qin

15
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:40,200
I heard that Zhang Xiaocao was fine yesterday

16
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,560
I made it clear to her

17
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,040
She won't come again

18
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:45,570
I only have you in my heart

19
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:49,380
It’s not that you don’t know, but

20
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,500
People in the village gossip

21
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:52,820
Let them talk

22
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:58,720
I have a clear conscience Xiao Xi

23
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:00,290
my whole life
